{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2022-10-31 10:35:00', 'title': 'OCEANIA CRUISES INTRODUCES 2024-2025 TROPICS & EXOTICS VOYAGES', 'text': "MIAMI , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- OCEANIA CRUISES, THE WORLD'S LEADING CULINARY- AND DESTINATION-FOCUSED CRUISE LINE, UNVEILED ITS 2024-2025 TROPICS AND EXOTICS COLLECTION OF ITINERARIES, WHICH OPEN FOR SALE ON NOVEMBER 2, 2022. THE NEW COLLECTION OF 157 VOYAGES SPANS SEVEN CONTINENTS AND RANGES FROM 7 TO 200 DAYS IN LENGTH."}